 Harry's long-standing desire to step away from royal duties. Gordon told that Harry \\\"wanted out from the crazy cult of royalty\\\" since childhood, and Meghan Markle was a \\\"catalyst\\\" for this.\\nThe Duke himself confirmed this sentiment on the Armchair Expert podcast in May 2021, expressing his reluctance to be part of the royal \\\"business model.\\\"\\nThis revelation sheds new light on the Sussexes' decision to step back from royal duties, emphasizing that it was not a sudden whim but a long-considered decision.\", \"original_answer\": \"Prince Harry had long planned to carve his own path and leave the royal family, according to royal correspondents and sources close to the Duke and Duchess of Sussex. Kensington Palace aides have confirmed that the split between the royal households and staff was part of a long-term plan to accommodate the growing families of the princes, including Princess Diana's sons, Prince Harry and Prince William. Prince Harry has expressed his reluctance to be part of the royal business model since childhood and viewed Meghan Markle as a catalyst for his desire to step away from royal duties.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}"}], "grammar": "root ::= \"{\" ws \"\\\"unsupported_probability\\\"\" ws \":\" ws probability ws \",\" ws \"\\\"source_sentence_id\\\"\" ws \":\" ws citation ws \"}\"\nprobability ::= \"0\" (\".\" [0-9]+)? | \"1\" (\".\" \"0\"+)?\ncitation ::= \"null\" | \"0\" | [1-9] [0-9]*\nws ::= [ \\t\\n\\r]*", "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 69058, "max_tokens": 96, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
