\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Worst grocery store in the world get outta Santa Barbara you SUUUUUUCK!!!!! Prices are too high for non organic food acting like it's organic n healthier just cause they don't package their produce so it's fresher even tho it's the same shit just trying to take our money, still going to Von's in other locations and by the way your stores are like ghost towns you ain't gonna survive hahahahah\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Haggen Food & Pharmacy, located at 163 S Turnpike Rd in Goleta, CA, is a local business that offers a variety of food and grocery products. The business has several categories including Food, Specialty Food, Grocery, Delis, Bakeries, Restaurants, and Health Markets. The business does not provide information about their hours of operation.\\n\\nAccording to customer reviews, Haggen Food & Pharmacy has received a low average rating of 1.5 stars. Customers have expressed dissatisfaction with various aspects of the business. One customer complained about the quality of their ice cream, specifically mentioning stale and gummy malt balls. Another customer expressed frustration with the business's recent changes, stating that they were happier with the previous grocery store option and now have to travel further for cheaper prices. The customer also mentioned layoffs of long-term employees as a point of contention. A third customer criticized the business for high prices on non-organic food and accused them of misleading customers by not packaging their produce. The customer also doubted the business's ability to survive in the market.\\n\\nBased on the provided structured data and customer reviews, it seems that Haggen Food & Pharmacy has faced criticism for the quality of their products, pricing, and recent changes.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
