on and were blown away. VIVA EL SITIO!\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"El Sitio is a local Mexican restaurant located in Goleta, California. With a rating of 3.5 stars, it offers reasonable prices and excellent quality. According to customer reviews, the restaurant provides delicious food, including the popular Quesarrito, which is highly recommended. However, some patrons have complained about the high cost of certain dishes, such as a $15 quesadilla with no cheese. Despite this, many customers appreciate the value offered by El Sitio, especially when compared to other nearby establishments. The atmosphere is casual, and there are mixed opinions regarding its ambiance, ranging from \\\"hipster\\\" to \\\"trendy.\\\" Overall, El Sitio seems to provide consistent quality at a fair price, making it a popular choice among locals and visitors alike.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
