ustry standards and not exceed certain surface area limits. For example, individual boxes should not exceed 16 square inches, and the aggregate surface area of all boxes combined per 100 square feet of surface area should not exceed 100 square inches.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
