nds of the NCAA Division I baseball tournament. Eight teams participate in the tournament, which is held at two designated sites. The tournament is divided into two stages: the group stage and the finals.\\n\\nIn the group stage, the eight teams are split into two bracket groups of four, and each team plays a double-elimination mini-tournament. The winner of each group advances to the finals, which is a best-of-three series to determine the national champion.\\n\\nThe College World Series is a best-of-three series, with games played on Monday, Tuesday, and (if necessary) Wednesday. The winner of the series is crowned the national champion.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}"}], "grammar": "root ::= \"{\" ws \"\\\"unsupported_probability\\\"\" ws \":\" ws probability ws \",\" ws \"\\\"source_sentence_id\\\"\" ws \":\" ws citation ws \"}\"\nprobability ::= \"0\" (\".\" [0-9]+)? | \"1\" (\".\" \"0\"+)?\ncitation ::= \"null\" | \"0\" | [1-9] [0-9]*\nws ::= [ \\t\\n\\r]*", "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 69058, "max_tokens": 96, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
