lly wonderful character. We just wanted him to stay and hang out afterwards.\\\\nYou won't be disappointed!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-02-09 04:12:03\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Thank you so much for such an amazing experience. Great food, wonderful service!!! Chef Benjamin and Donna were super professional and nice. Definitely something we will order again.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2020-09-14 17:25:38\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I chose SB Paella Catering to cater a bridal shower I was throwing at my home. We had 10 guests for an intimate gathering. We are a group of girls who love to eat! That being said, having them cater this party was something special! Benjamin was very interactive with us, you can tell right away his passion for paella and how it's been apart of his life since he was a kid! \\\\n\\\\nNot only did we enjoy watching, but the paella tasted amazing! Very authentic, bursting with layers of flavor and we had plenty of enough food to go around. \\\\n\\\\nSuch a special experience to bring everyone together to the dinner table to enjoy their paella.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"SB Paella Catering is a highly-rated business located in Goleta, CA, operating within categories such as Caterers, Restaurants, Spanish, Personal Chefs, and Event Planning & Services. They offer services from Tuesday to Saturday with varying hours. The business does not offer amenities like Business Parking, Outdoor Seating, Wifi, or Music. The ambiance is described as classy. Customers have given rave reviews, consistently rating the business 5 stars. They have particularly praised the delicious, authentic paella, professional service, and interactive cooking process. Chefs Benjamin and Carol have been specifically mentioned for their exceptional culinary skills and communication.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3