ood deal to get a soup and sandwich combo for $9 after tax. I got the Italian salami sandwich. Beware, there is quite a bit of unexpected butter there. Overall, very tasty combination of ingredients. \\\\n\\\\nI loved the quinoa and corn soup! It seems homemade since there isn't an abnormally thick texture and too salty. This tastes fresh and hearty. Combo is the right amount of food :)\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2018-05-03 00:25:49\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Fresh, local, easy, and simply delicious. \\\\n\\\\nGrab-and-go salads are very good,  reasonable, and there is a diverse selection. Sesame noodle is my personal fave. Very filling and tasty. \\\\n\\\\nOn the sweet side, they do very well too.  The lemon tart is amazing! \\\\n\\\\nAlso, I'm always on the hunt  for who makes the best chocolate chip cookies in town....For  Santa Barbara,  I nominate these as one of  the best:  full of chunky chocolate chips and a nice sprinkle of salt on top. mmmm!\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Flagstone Pantry is a specialty food store and café located in downtown Santa Barbara, offering a variety of healthy and delicious options for breakfast, lunch, and snacks. According to customer reviews, the menu features soups, sandwiches, salads, and cookies that are made with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. The store offers a convenient grab-and-go format, making it a great option for busy individuals looking for a quick and healthy meal. Customers rave about the quinoa and corn soup, Italian salami sandwich, and chocolate chip cookies, which are considered some of the best in town. The café also offers outdoor seating and free Wi-Fi, making it a pleasant spot to enjoy a meal or work remotely. With a 4.5-star rating and positive customer reviews, Flagstone Pantry is a popular choice for those seeking healthy, fresh, and tasty food in Santa Barbara.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_