 value and a full bar. Reviewers have praised the nicely renovated interior, low prices, and lively vibe. While it may not be as well-known as some other bars in the area, it has established itself as a go-to destination for a fun night out. The establishment is open late and offers a variety of amenities, including pool tables and good Mexican food nearby. Overall, Notown Tavern receives high marks from customers, earning a rating of 5.0 stars.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}"}], "grammar": "root ::= \"{\" ws \"\\\"unsupported_probability\\\"\" ws \":\" ws probability ws \",\" ws \"\\\"source_sentence_id\\\"\" ws \":\" ws citation ws \"}\"\nprobability ::= \"0\" (\".\" [0-9]+)? | \"1\" (\".\" \"0\"+)?\ncitation ::= \"null\" | \"0\" | [1-9] [0-9]*\nws ::= [ \\t\\n\\r]*", "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 69058, "max_tokens": 96, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
