4.49.834.153 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "Estimate the probability that the complete original answer contains any span unsupported by its original source. The target always refers to the ORIGINAL source, even when source evidence has been erased. Erasure removes information and does not change the answer's correctness. Return only a JSON object with unsupported_probability and source_sentence_id. Use null when no visible source sentence is a proposed witness."}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"complete_source\": \"{\\\"address\\\":\\\"20 E Cota St\\\",\\\"attributes\\\":{\\\"Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":null,\\\"classy\\\":true,\\\"divey\\\":null,\\\"hipster\\\":null,\\\"intimate\\\":null,\\\"romantic\\\":true,\\\"touristy\\\":null,\\\"trendy\\\":true,\\\"upscale\\\":null},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":false,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":false,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":null,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":null},\\\"business_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Mediterranean, Bars, Restaurants, Nightlife\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"16:0-20:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"0:0-0:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"16:0-20:0\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"16:0-20:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"16:0-20:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"16:0-20:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Mezza Thyme\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-08-25 02:13:40\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"These guys are the best. As a pita bread connoisseur I have high standards, and this pita is one of the best. Made fresh out of the oven, it didn't even need any dip. definitely recommend!!!\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-07-21 03:42:32\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"We had a group so ordered the large chicken platter and added some falafel and baba gannoujgh...it was plenty of food and flavored well. Loved the garlic sauce and the pita tasted like home made tortilla. Very happy with this place\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-07-06 01:32:05\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Good Middle East inspired food. The only downside is that the prices are steep for what they serve.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Mezza Thyme is a Mediterranean restaurant located in Santa Barbara, CA, known for its delicious pita bread and flavorful dishes. The restaurant has a rating of 5 stars and is praised for its freshly made pita, garlic sauce, and home-made tortilla. Customers have mentioned that the large chicken platter and added falafel and baba gannoujgh are enough to feed a group, and the food is well-priced. However, some customers have noted that the prices are a bit steep for what they serve. Mezza Thyme offers takeout and good for groups, and has a trendy ambiance. It is open from 4 pm to 8 pm from Tuesday to Saturday, and is closed on Mondays and Sundays.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}"}], "add_generation_prompt": true, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
