 large chicken platter and added some falafel and baba gannoujgh...it was plenty of food and flavored well. Loved the garlic sauce and the pita tasted like home made tortilla. Very happy with this place\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-07-06 01:32:05\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":4.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Good Middle East inspired food. The only downside is that the prices are steep for what they serve.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Mezza Thyme is a Mediterranean restaurant located in Santa Barbara, CA, known for its delicious pita bread and flavorful dishes. The restaurant has a rating of 5 stars and is praised for its freshly made pita, garlic sauce, and home-made tortilla. Customers have mentioned that the large chicken platter and added falafel and baba gannoujgh are enough to feed a group, and the food is well-priced. However, some customers have noted that the prices are a bit steep for what they serve. Mezza Thyme offers takeout and good for groups, and has a trendy ambiance. It is open from 4 pm to 8 pm from Tuesday to Saturday, and is closed on Mondays and Sundays.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}"}], "grammar": "root ::= \"{\" ws \"\\\"unsupported_probability\\\"\" ws \":\" ws probability ws \",\" ws \"\\\"source_sentence_id\\\"\" ws \":\" ws citation ws \"}\"\nprobability ::= \"0\" (\".\" [0-9]+)? | \"1\" (\".\" \"0\"+)?\ncitation ::= \"null\" | \"0\" | [1-9] [0-9]*\nws ::= [ \\t\\n\\r]*", "temperature": 0, "top_p": 1, "seed": 69058, "max_tokens": 96, "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}
