rices are steep for what they serve.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Mezza Thyme is a Mediterranean restaurant located in Santa Barbara, CA, known for its delicious pita bread and flavorful dishes. The restaurant has a rating of 5 stars and is praised for its freshly made pita, garlic sauce, and home-made tortilla. Customers have mentioned that the large chicken platter and added falafel and baba gannoujgh are enough to feed a group, and the food is well-priced. However, some customers have noted that the prices are a bit steep for what they serve. Mezza Thyme offers takeout and good for groups, and has a trendy ambiance. It is open from 4 pm to 8 pm from Tuesday to Saturday, and is closed on Mondays and Sundays.\", \"target\": \"any_unsupported_span_in_original_response\", \"visible_source_sentence_ids\": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], \"source_evidence_erased\": false}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
